---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "ok(dir.path(), &[\"kv-cache\", \"tiny.gguf\", \"--ctx\", \"2048\"])"
---
KV cache estimate for tiny.gguf (llama)

  block_count    2
  head_count     4
  head_count_kv  2      grouped-query attention, 2 heads per KV head
  key_length     64     embedding_length 256 / head_count 4
  value_length   64     embedding_length 256 / head_count 4
  cache type     f16    2 bytes per element
  context        2,048  tokens per sequence
  sequences      1

formula
  K per layer and token = row_size(f16, 2 x 64 = 128) = 256 B
  V per layer and token = row_size(f16, 2 x 64 = 128) = 256 B
  total = sequences x ctx x block_count x (K + V)
        = 1 x 2,048 x 2 x 512 B
        = 2,097,152 B (2.00 MiB)
